OL,3,GNEWSAGroping policeman boasted of
OL,4,Ahurting people
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer who groped a woman
OL,7,Fafter boasting about hurting people in
OL,8,Fhis job has been given a suspended
OL,9,Fsentence.
OL,11,FDaniel Hedley, 34, was working for
OL,12,FNorthumbria Police while studying for a
OL,13,Flaw degree at Durham University, where
OL,14,Fyounger students were alarmed by his
OL,15,Factions and the way he would brag about
OL,16,Fthem, Teesside Crown Court heard.
OL,18,FA woman who Hedley groped on a night
OL,19,Fout said she had "completely lost
OL,20,Ftrust" in the police as a result of her
OL,21,Fexperience.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
