OL,3,GNEWSAGroping policeman boasted of
OL,4,Ahurting people
OL,5,
OL,6,FHedley, from Morpeth, denied wrongdoing
OL,7,Fbut was jailed for eight months
OL,8,Fsuspended for a year and a half after
OL,9,Fbeing found guilty of sexual assault.
OL,10,FThe court heard he had since been
OL,11,Fdismissed from the force for gross
OL,12,Fmisconduct.
